# The image build context: the checkout without its build outputs or scratch. The family tables datasets/*.toml stay:
# the wheel carries them, and `fetch` writes them where the engine reads them. So do the tracked directories of our
# families, datasets/<family>/: the bench stage checks that the context holds every tracked file.
target/
scratch/
datasets/*
!datasets/*.toml
!datasets/*/
**/__pycache__/
*.whl
# The data package's fetched files: its wheel stage fetches them by pin (container/Dockerfile jth-build).
packages/orbitar-jth/orbitar_jth/*
!packages/orbitar-jth/orbitar_jth/__init__.py
